OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fbecoming confined to coasts this
OL,7,Fevening before dying out overnight.
OL,8,FLong clear spells developing and, with
OL,9,Fwinds falling light, a touch of frost
OL,10,Fis possible in well-sheltered spots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA bright start but cloud
OL,13,Fsoon increasing from the west bringing
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain to most places by
OL,15,Fmidday. The rain becoming occasionally
OL,16,Fheavy in the afternoon. Strengthening
OL,17,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
