OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing overnight then sunny spells
OL,7,Fand blustery heavy showers Friday and
OL,8,FSaturday, the showers easing later
OL,9,FSaturday. Mostly dry and bright
OL,10,FSunday, some rain may reach western
OL,11,Fcounties later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
